  ('cand_org_lekki_solar_company_limited_9114158d', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-003', 'agent_web_sweep', 'LEKKI SOLAR COMPANY LIMITED', 'http://www.lekkisolar.com', 'NG', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as a member company in the REAN directory (Ikota Shopping Complex, VGC, Lagos). Its site rendered only a tagline, so the role could not be verified.', 'https://rean.org.ng/our-members/page/2/', 0),
