  ('cand_org_ignite_f785ac66', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-027', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Ignite', '', 'MZ, ZM', 'org_role_energy_service_company,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_operators', 'Listed in the BGFA contracted-projects table as ''Ignite [former: Engie Energy Access] — Solar home systems — Zambia''. The bracketed note is the source''s own annotation that this is the renamed ENGIE Energy Access Zambia business.', 'https://beyondthegrid.africa/our-projects/', 0),
  ('cand_org_energyneering_zimbabwe_c73b6ef1', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-027', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Energyneering Zimbabwe', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_epc,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_utility_generation,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member, 12th Floor Joina City, Harare. Profile: ''Energyneering Zimbabwe EPCM is a one-stop renewable Engineering, Procurement, Construction, Management, Monitoring & Maintenance - turnkey solutions provider. We design, implement, and manage energy projects across the African continent.'' Verticals include utility and enterprise-level solar, residential solar, HVAC and refrigeration, water pumping. Schneider Electric SolarXpert Business Partner and Offgridbox ''solutions integrator, d', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/energyneering-zimbabwe', 0),
  ('cand_org_elaine_solar_africa_b49707e8', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-027', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Elaine Solar Africa', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member, 624 Scanlane Drive, Borrowdale, Harare. Profile: ''a registered company that sells, install and maintain solar systems for both rural and urban areas... big and small systems for home and corporate scales''.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/elaine-solar-africa', 0),
  ('cand_org_solar_energy_projects_d1ca5db3', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-027', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Solar Energy Projects', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_installer,org_role_epc', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member, No. 16 Campbell Avenue, Pomona, Harare. Profile: ''Solar Energy Projects (SEP) is a leader in solar energy services and solar power provider'', run by an electrical engineer with 35 years'' Zimbabwe experience and a renewable energy engineer who ''designs most of SEPs Solar installations''. Products: solar water heating, backup and off-grid solar power, solar water pumping, wind and hydro power.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/solar-energy-projects', 0),
  ('cand_org_tendo_electronics_8adaf5f3', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-027', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Tendo Electronics', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_system_integrator,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_energy_storage', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member, 21 Birmingham Rd, Southerton, Harare. Profile: ''Tendo Electronics and Power Engineering is a total solutions provider... supplying, installing, servicing and maintaining UPS, standby generators, inverters... Renewable Energy equipment... including providing comprehensive infrastructure and energy management''.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/tendo-electronics-0', 0),
  ('cand_org_shinko_afrika_8f3fad7b', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'SHINKO AFRIKA', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_installer,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member, 55 Lawley Avenue, Belvedere, Harare. Profile: ''a provider of solar power and water pumping systems incorporated 2019 with the goal to curb the ever increasing water and power supply shortages in the nation''.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/shinko-afrika', 1),
  ('cand_org_greentec_energy_e06fc10d', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Greentec Energy', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_clean_cooking,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member. Profile: ''GreenZim Ventures P/L t/a GreenTEC Energy was registered in 2012... a waste-to-energy company operating in Zimbabwe specializing in the construction, installation, repair, and maintenance of biogas systems for both domestic and commercial'', plus bio-digesters for wastewater treatment. Named delivery record: 46 biogas digesters in Zibagwe RDC (Kwekwe Rural) in 2023, and digesters at milk collection centres under a USAID grant in 2024.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/greentec-energy-0', 0),
  ('cand_org_powerlive_zimbabwe_p_l_0cc77144', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Powerlive Zimbabwe P/L', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_energy_service_company,org_role_installer,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_operators', 'REAZ industry member, 21 Vincent Avenue, Belvedere, Harare. Profile: ''a for profit women-led social enterprise that sells, distributes and installs high-quality decentralized and scalable... Home and Business Energy Systems on Pay As You Go (PAYG) basis to off-grid residential households, small scale farmers and schools in the rural and peri-urban areas of Zimbabwe''.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/powerlive-zimbabwe-pl', 0),
  ('cand_org_onyx_earth_private_ltd_f09ee371', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Onyx Earth Private Ltd', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_installer,org_role_epc', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'REAZ industry member. Profile: ''a premier construction company based in Harare, Zimbabwe''; its listed services include ''Solar supply & installation'' and ''Irrigation equipment installation'' alongside wastewater treatment plant construction and roads. Included because of the explicit solar installation service line plus membership of the national renewable energy association; note it is a general construction firm, not a solar pure-play.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/onyx-earth-private-ltd', 0),
  ('cand_org_celfre_energy_pvt_ltd_4894d749', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Celfre Energy Pvt Ltd', 'http://celfreenergy.co.zw/', 'ZW', 'org_role_energy_service_company,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_operators', 'REAZ industry member, 12 Wycombe Drive, Mount Pleasant, Harare. Profile: started operations 2017, ''a provider of high-quality and affordable renewable energy solutions for productive use... mainly on solar water pumps for sustainable irrigation for small holder farmers, solar powered agro-processing machines and solar refrigeration''. Holds exclusive distributorship of Future Pump solar irrigation units and sells productive-use equipment on Pay As You Go.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/celfre-energy-pvt-ltd', 0),
  ('cand_org_kumusha_power_e2e89c32', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Kumusha Power', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'REAZ industry member, 12 Maasdorp Avenue, Alexandra Park, Harare. Profile: ''Goodbooks Investments (Private) Limited t/a Kumusha Power'', distributing in Zimbabwe since 2010; added d.light Solar Home Systems in 2019 and distributes them through a retail distributor and partner network to rural and peri-urban Zimbabwe.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/kumusha-power', 0),
  ('cand_org_nyangani_renewable_energy_f769dabe', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Nyangani Renewable Energy', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as an industry member of the Renewable Energy Association of Zimbabwe, 21 Mold Crescent, Avondale, Harare, with a named contact. The REAZ member page gives contact details only and no description of activities, so the role could not be established from the source. NEEDS MANUAL CLASSIFICATION.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/nyangani-renewable-energy', 0),
  ('cand_org_aurora_energy_5486b440', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Aurora Energy', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as an industry member of the Renewable Energy Association of Zimbabwe, 1 College Road, Mt Pleasant, Harare, with a named contact and phone numbers. The REAZ member page gives contact details only and no description of activities. NEEDS MANUAL CLASSIFICATION.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/aurora-energy', 0),
  ('cand_org_grid_zero_b58411e0', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Grid Zero', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as an industry member of the Renewable Energy Association of Zimbabwe, 101 Robert Mugabe Rd, Harare, with a named contact. The REAZ member page gives contact details only and no description of activities. NEEDS MANUAL CLASSIFICATION.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/grid-zero', 1),
  ('cand_org_solar_shack_fd833016', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Solar Shack', 'http://solarshack.co.zw/', 'ZW', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as an industry member of the Renewable Energy Association of Zimbabwe, 21 Glenara Avenue South, Eastlea, Harare, with a named contact and the website above. The REAZ member page gives contact details only and no description of activities. NEEDS MANUAL CLASSIFICATION.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/solar-shack', 0),
  ('cand_org_faraday_electrical_engineering_company_4562f609', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Faraday Electrical Engineering Company', '', 'ZW', 'org_role_to_classify', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as an industry member of the Renewable Energy Association of Zimbabwe, 8 Harare Drive, Msasa, Harare. The REAZ member page gives contact details only and no description of activities; the name suggests an electrical engineering contractor and the only energy-sector evidence is the REAZ membership itself. NEEDS MANUAL CLASSIFICATION.', 'https://reaz.co.zw/members/faraday-electrical-engineering-company', 0),
  ('cand_org_neoen_f1368e1b', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Neoen', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_developer_ipp', 'org_segment_utility_generation', 'org_group_developers', 'Same article: the 41MWp Metoro solar project ''is being developed and managed by Neoen, a renewable IPP, and is jointly owned by Neoen and EDM through the company Central Solar Metoro''.', 'https://www.esi-africa.com/renewable-energy/solar/efacec-awarded-epc-contract-for-41mwp-plant-in-mozambique/', 0),
  ('cand_org_enhl_bonatti_9c1cbf03', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'ENHL Bonatti', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_epc', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_energy_storage', 'org_group_epcs', '''ENHL Bonatti is pleased to announce it has been awarded the EPC Contract for the installation of a Solar Photovoltaic and Battery System at the Balama Graphite Mine in the Cabo Delgado Province'' - 11.25 MWp PV plus 8.5 MW BESS, full turnkey scope (engineering, procurement, construction, commissioning, testing). Described on the page as ''an incorporated Joint Venture between ENH Logistics (a subsidiary of the Mozambican National Oil Company, ENH) and international contractor Bonatti Group''.', 'https://www.bonattinternational.com/mozambique-enhl-bonatti-signs-an-epc-contract-for-the-balama-mine-hybrid-power-project', 1),
  ('cand_org_solarcentury_africa_20dcfd89', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Solarcentury Africa', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_energy_storage', 'org_group_operators', 'Same announcement: ''ENHL Bonatti and Solarcentury Africa also signed a separate agreement relating to the operation & maintenance of the Solar PV Facility for a 2-years period'' at the Balama Graphite Mine, Cabo Delgado, Mozambique.', 'https://www.bonattinternational.com/mozambique-enhl-bonatti-signs-an-epc-contract-for-the-balama-mine-hybrid-power-project', 0),
  ('cand_org_renco_73433cb1', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Renco', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_epc,org_role_developer_ipp', 'org_segment_utility_generation', 'org_group_epcs', 'RENCO project page for the Mecufi solar park, Mozambique: 26 MW installed, 30 hectares, 200 employees for its construction. Project fields state Client: ''Electricidade de Moçambique'', Contractor: ''Renco / Renco Tek'', Location: Pemba, with a 25-year land concession held via Central Solar de Mecúfi.', 'https://www.renco.it/projects/solar-park-mecufi', 0),
  ('cand_org_bdd_energia_mocambique_fcf9292f', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'BDD Energia Mocambique', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_developers', 'Listed under ''IPPs and Mini-grid operators'': ''BDD Energia Mocambique - A mini-grid development company supported by REACT SSA. BDD Energia''s most recent project is the electrification of the Chiloane island in the Sofala Province. The project consists of the construction of a 130 kWp Solar PV mini-grid system to connect 760 households and 29 businesses.'' Page last edited September 2022.', 'https://energypedia.info/wiki/Nano/Mini-Grid_Market_Landscape_in_Mozambique', 1),
  ('cand_org_rve_sol_solu_es_de_energia_rural_s_a_918d2154', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'RVE.SOL Soluções de Energia Rural S.A.', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_developers', 'Listed under ''IPPs and Mini-grid operators'': ''RVE.SOL Soluções de Energia Rural S.A. A mini-grid developer and operator Company supported by REACT SSA. Through their project Kudura Mini Grid, RVE.SOL has installed several mini-grids in Kenya and East Africa. They are just starting in Mozambique since 2021.'' Also appears in the ALER member list as ''RVE.SOL S.A.''', 'https://energypedia.info/wiki/Nano/Mini-Grid_Market_Landscape_in_Mozambique', 0),
  ('cand_org_mewton_mota_engil_energia_2712dc23', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Mewton – Mota-Engil Energia', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_developer_ipp', '', 'org_group_epcs', 'ALER member directory entry tagged with countries Angola and Moçambique (code 6482) and with service codes 7171 (EPC), 7172 (Instalação de Equipamentos), 7173 (Operação & Manutenção) and 7170 (Promotor de Projectos). Description: ''A Mewton cria valor através do desenvolvimento e implementação de soluções energéticas personalizadas e sustentáveis... desenvolvemos, construímos e operamos soluções personalizadas que vão de 1 a 100MW ou mais.''', 'https://www.aler-energia.org/pt/associados/lista-associados/', 0),
  ('cand_org_cjr_renewables_dd3a59fe', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'CJR Renewables', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_epc', 'org_segment_utility_generation', 'org_group_epcs', 'ALER member directory entry tagged with Moçambique (code 6482) among its countries of operation and with service code 7171 (EPC). Description: ''A CJR Renewables é uma empresa de serviços integrados em regime EPC e BoP, especializada na construção de parques eólicos. Opera de forma transversal em todas as fases do processo, incluindo projeto e otimização, construção civil, instalação elétrica, transporte e montagem de aerogeradores.'' Note: Portugal-headquartered; the Mozambique link is the associ', 'https://www.aler-energia.org/pt/associados/lista-associados/', 0),
  ('cand_org_epsilon_a0337451', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Epsilon', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Market table entry: operating in Mozambique since 2017 in Manica, Tete and Zambezia; distributor of Greenlight Planet''s Sun King Home 60 and Home 400 systems; over 7,000 units by Oct 2021; PAYGO plus direct sales.', 'https://energypedia.info/wiki/Solar_Home_System_Market_Landscape_in_Mozambique', 0),
  ('cand_org_digitech_d70d26c6', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Digitech', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Market table entry: operating in Mozambique since 2020 in Gaza, Inhambane, Nampula and Cabo Delgado; 4-400 W; distributor; PAYGO plus direct sales.', 'https://energypedia.info/wiki/Solar_Home_System_Market_Landscape_in_Mozambique', 0),
  ('cand_org_uranus_solar_fe5d167c', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Uranus Solar', '', 'MZ', 'org_role_energy_service_company,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_operators', 'Market table entry: operating in Mozambique since 2020; 6-40 W systems; 1,000 units until March 2022; PAYGO financing model.', 'https://energypedia.info/wiki/Solar_Home_System_Market_Landscape_in_Mozambique', 0),
  ('cand_org_compagnie_marocco_s_n_galaise_d_electric_c88953da', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Compagnie Marocco-Sénégalaise d''Electricité (COMASEL)', '', 'SN', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_developers', 'Table 3.1 ''Rural Electrification Concessions under the PPER Program (2015)'': operator of Concession 1 (Dagana-Podor-Saint Louis, signed 30 May 2008) and Concession 2 (Louga-Linguère-Kébémer, signed 20 Nov 2009), strategic partner ONEE (Morocco). Report adds COMASEL had obtained ~2,500 solar home systems and uses pre-paid meters for grid-connected clients.', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_energie_rural_africaine_era_150af512', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Energie Rural Africaine (ERA)', '', 'SN', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_developers', 'Table 3.1: operator of Concession 3 (Kaffrine-Tamba-Kedougou, signed 29 June 2011, in force 24 Dec 2013), strategic partner EDF; target 18,001 connections. Report states ''The concessionaire ERA is extending the grid using cement poles'' and that ERA had obtained ~1,500 solar home systems. Name spelled ''Energie Rural Africaine'' in the source.', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_scl_energie_solutions_7cc691fb', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-028', 'agent_web_sweep', 'SCL Energie Solutions', '', 'SN', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_transmission_distribution,org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_developers', 'Table 3.1: operator of Concession 4 (Mbour, signed 9 Nov 2012) as consortium ''SCL (Energie solutions, STEG International Services, les Câbleries du Sénégal, COSELEC)''; target 7,500 connections. Report states ''The concessionaire SCL Energie Solutions is installing single phase grid extensions'' and that it uses pre-paid meters.', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0);

insert or ignore into organisation_candidates (id, batch_id, source_kind, name, website, countries, role_ids, segment_ids, actor_group_id, evidence_note, source_url, flagged_personal) values
  ('cand_org_enco_s_n_gal_4cc6dab2', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'ENCO Sénégal', '', 'SN', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_transmission_distribution,org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_developers', 'Table 3.1: ''Groupement ENCO Sénégal /ISOFOTON'' holds Concession 5 (Kolda-Vélingara, signed 29 July 2013, in force 24 April 2015, 20,500 connections) and Concession 6 (Kaolack-Nioro-Fatick-Gossas, signed 22 Nov 2012, in force 12 Nov 2014, 27,000 connections).', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_ss2e_e721dc9e', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'SS2E', '', 'SN', 'org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution', 'org_group_operators', 'Named as a private operator recruited under ASER''s Gestion Transitoire Déléguée (GTD) programme to manage rural power assets (generators and grid extension) under 25-year affermage contracts; ''SS2E won one of the lots'' in the January 2005 procurement. Dated evidence (2005 award, 2017 report).', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_equip_plus_666bba7f', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'EQUIP PLUS', '', 'SN', 'org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution', 'org_group_operators', 'Named as one of the GTD (Gestion Transitoire Déléguée) delegated operators managing rural power assets for ASER: ''SENELEC did not sign power purchase agreement with two of the GTDs (SS2E and EQUIP PLUS)''. Dated evidence.', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_gserm_03dd6b65', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'GSERM', '', 'SN', 'org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution', 'org_group_operators', 'Bid as ''GSERM/SODIDA'' in the January 2005 ASER GTD procurement and ''GSERM won a single lot''; delegated manager of rural power assets under a 25-year affermage contract. Dated evidence.', 'https://documents1.worldbank.org/curated/en/710071498161444599/pdf/116653-WP-PUBLIC-P150241-36p-Detailed-Case-Study-Senegal.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_nadji_bi_2d765049', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Nadji-Bi', '', 'SN', 'org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among the tier-3 companies in Senegal''s off-grid supply chain and among the ''fabricants locaux''. Also appears in Tableau 40 as a brand for productive-use and single-module home systems (spelled ''Nadji.bi'' there).', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_solar_energy_senegal_ses_4b67cb3e', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Solar Energy Senegal (SES)', '', 'SN', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Tableau 40 lists ''Solar Energy Senegal (SES)'' under single-module distributors, multi-module system distributors and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes'' (very large system supplier) — the top size category in the table.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_touba_solar_rama_5797f151', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Touba Solar Rama', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Tableau 40: single-module distributor, multi-module system distributor and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''. The report''s prose spells the same firm ''Touba Rama Solar''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_rayon_vert_ec78299d', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Rayon Vert', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Described in prose as a ''représentant des fabricants'' and a distributor; Tableau 40 lists it under single-module, multi-module and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_coseer_ddf9bd63', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'COSEER', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose as a ''représentant des fabricants''; Tableau 40 lists it (spelled ''Coseer'') under pico, single-module, multi-module and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_salen_sol_85dd194c', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Salen Sol', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Tableau 40: single-module distributor, multi-module system distributor and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_lectricit_du_rip_d97eda39', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Électricité du Rip', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer,org_role_developer_ipp', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_transmission_distribution', 'org_group_oems', 'Tableau 40: multi-module system distributor and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''. Likely the same entity as the rural electrification project company ''Electricity of Rip'' referenced in Senegalese concession reporting, but only the off-grid supply role is evidenced on this page.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_suntaeg_energy_d89687d6', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Suntaeg Energy', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose among the wholesalers (''grossistes (Suntaeg Energy, Saloum Energy, etc.)''); Tableau 40 lists it under pico, single-module and multi-module distributors. No explicit installation evidence — classify with care.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_idm_services_bcd1ca49', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'IDM Services', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Tableau 40: single-module and multi-module system distributor in Senegal. No explicit installation evidence on this page.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_rosif_b8f62850', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Rosif', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Tableau 40: multi-module system distributor and ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''. The table spells the name inconsistently — ''Rosif'' in one row, ''Résif'' in the next; treat spelling as unconfirmed.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_saloum_energie_10e41be0', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Saloum Energie', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose among the ''représentants des fabricants'' in Senegal''s off-grid solar supply chain; also referred to as a wholesaler (spelled ''Saloum Energy'' in that sentence).', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_futur_tech_c7a78ed3', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Futur Tech', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose both among the ''représentants des fabricants'' and among the ''distributeurs (Touba Rama Solar, Rayon Vert, Futur Tech, etc.)''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_leaf_energy_64fc67fb', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Leaf Energy', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose among the ''représentants des fabricants'' in Senegal''s off-grid solar supply chain.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_soleil_eau_vie_08edba26', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Soleil-Eau-Vie', '', 'SN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose among the ''représentants des fabricants'' in Senegal''s off-grid solar supply chain.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_palette_aa8d0e5e', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Palette', '', 'SN', 'org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named as one of Senegal''s local solar manufacturers: ''des fabricants locaux (Bonergie, Nadji Bi et Palette, etc.)''. No installation evidence.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Senegal/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Senegal_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_agt_senegal_622dce88', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'AGT Senegal', 'https://www.africagreentec.com', 'SN', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_installer,org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_developers', 'Africa GreenTec''s Senegal subsidiary, headquartered in Dakar and operating in the N''diob region; manufactures Solartainers and Cooltainers for the African market, runs production, logistics and O&M, and deploys solar mini-grid ImpactSites. Plans to equip 50 villages in Senegal.', 'https://www.africagreentec.com/en/presse/africa-greentec-relocates-production-to-senegal/', 1),
  ('cand_org_yeelen_kura_63f89215', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Yeelen Kura', '', 'ML', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_installer,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_developers', 'Case study, ''Yeelen Kura: Mini-grid and solar home systems'': launched 2001, operates 15 mini-grids serving over 7,000 households in southern Mali (Sikasso, Ségou, Koulikoro), grids from 30 kWp to 150 kWp; has sold 3,500 solar home systems. Sole shareholder is the Dutch Foundation Rural Energy Services (FRES). Also listed in the report''s table ''Decentralised energy providers in Mali''.', 'https://www.gsma.com/solutions-and-impact/connectivity-for-good/mobile-for-development/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Mobile-for-Development-Utilities-The-potential-of-mobile-for-rural-energy-access-in-Mali.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_sinergie_4c9cc54e', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Sinergie', '', 'ML', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'Case study: ''In operation since the late 1990s, Sinergie has worked on hundreds of off- and on-grid projects in over 520 villages'', developing solar heating, street lighting, water pumps and cooling with World Bank financial support. Also in the report''s table ''Decentralised energy providers in Mali'' — service listed as ''On and off-grid projects''.', 'https://www.gsma.com/solutions-and-impact/connectivity-for-good/mobile-for-development/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Mobile-for-Development-Utilities-The-potential-of-mobile-for-rural-energy-access-in-Mali.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_sunna_design_54fedc56', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Sunna Design', '', 'ML', 'org_role_installer,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Case study: ''Sunna Design installs street lights and mini-grids in rural villages of Mali, particularly in southern and central regions''; its mini-grids use a PAYG daily-fee model. Also in the table ''Decentralised energy providers in Mali'' — service ''Street lighting and mini-grid''.', 'https://www.gsma.com/solutions-and-impact/connectivity-for-good/mobile-for-development/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Mobile-for-Development-Utilities-The-potential-of-mobile-for-rural-energy-access-in-Mali.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_agt_mali_2c288939', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'AGT Mali', 'https://www.africagreentec.com', 'ML', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_developers', 'Africa GreenTec''s Mali subsidiary, founded August 2017, headquartered in Bamako, managing director Alou Keita. Page maps at least 12 ImpactSite (solar mini-grid) installations including Sirakoro, Fanidiama, Djoliba, Bananso, Lambatara, Tambaga, Toukoto, Kaï and Cinzana-Gare.', 'https://www.africagreentec.com/en/where-we-work/mali/', 1),
  ('cand_org_yeelen_djiguima_fb00b0e7', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-029', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Yeelen Djiguima', '', 'ML', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among the main international and regional companies in Mali; distributes Lagazel Kalo pico lamps manufactured in Dédougou (Burkina Faso) through association and cooperative networks, offering both cash and PAYG consumer finance; also manufactures its own solar equipment locally. Report states these companies ''offrent généralement des services d''installation, d''exploitation et de maintenance après-vente''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_afrika_solar_c2f425ec', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Afrika Solar', '', 'ML', 'org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Described as ''une startup franco-malienne du secteur solaire lancée en 2015'' that manufactures its own small pico solar lamps from recycled materials; named among the main companies distributing pico lamps, plug-and-play and single-module SHS in Mali.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_mes_international_82c722c2', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'MES International', '', 'ML', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_epcs', '''Total Awango, Access, MES International et Oolu Solar travaillent avec l''initiative d''électrification rurale d''AMADER'' — i.e. named as a company working with Mali''s rural electrification agency AMADER.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_horonya_solar_a014b2c0', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Horonya Solar', '', 'ML', 'org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', '''Horonya Solar est le seul assembleur local de panneaux solaires dans le pays'' (the only local solar panel assembler in Mali); also named (as ''Horonya'') among growth-stage companies offering pico, SHS and single/multi-module systems, and acting as a wholesaler.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_atlas_electronique_2ca756e0', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Atlas Electronique', '', 'ML', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_equipment_supplier', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among Mali''s launch/growth-stage solar companies offering pico, SHS and single/multi-module systems, acting as a manufacturer representative and distributor (spelled ''Altas Electronique'' in one sentence of the report).', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_soninkara_solaire_188cbdf7', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Soninkara Solaire', '', 'ML', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among Mali''s launch/growth-stage solar companies offering pico, SHS and single/multi-module systems, and among the wholesalers (there spelled ''Soninkara Solar Electro'').', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Mali/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Mali_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_sahelia_solar_725b0f40', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Sahelia Solar', '', 'BF', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named as a tier-2 regional company operating ''au Burkina Faso et au Mali'', and listed among the firms that are ''verticalement intégrées et actives dans tous les domaines de la chaîne d''approvisionnement (Africa Energy Solaire, Burkina Trading International et Sahelia Solar)''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_africa_energy_solaire_4c78eca4', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Africa Energy Solaire', '', 'BF', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named as a manufacturer representative (''Africa Energy Solaire est le distributeur de Victron'') and as one of three firms ''verticalement intégrées et actives dans tous les domaines de la chaîne d''approvisionnement''. Report notes some of these firms ''offrent également des services d''installation et d''F&E''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_burkina_trading_international_90a404dd', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Burkina Trading International', '', 'BF', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named as one of three Burkinabè solar firms ''verticalement intégrées et actives dans tous les domaines de la chaîne d''approvisionnement (Africa Energy Solaire, Burkina Trading International et Sahelia Solar)''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_sirea_afrique_e2ad2959', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'SIREA Afrique', '', 'BF', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_energy_storage', 'org_group_epcs', 'Singled out with PPI as an exception among wholesalers/retailers: ''à l''exception de SIREA Afrique et de PPI, deux entreprises qui vendent principalement de grands systèmes solaires'' (two companies selling mainly large solar systems).', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 1),
  ('cand_org_ppi_6d5ff4ff', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'PPI', '', 'BF', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named with SIREA Afrique as one of two Burkinabè companies ''qui vendent principalement de grands systèmes solaires''. Source gives only the acronym ''PPI'' — full legal name not stated.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_yeleen_ba_fres_defb2338', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Yeleen Ba (FRES)', '', 'BF', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_developers', 'Named among the largest tier-3 companies present in the Burkina Faso off-grid market, written verbatim as ''Yeleen Ba (FRES)'' — the Burkinabè operating company of the Dutch Foundation Rural Energy Services, sister utility to Yeelen Kura in Mali.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_benoo_e40a4b5c', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Benoo', '', 'BF', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among the largest tier-3 companies present in the Burkina Faso off-grid solar market: ''BBOXX, Total, Benoo, Greenlight Planet, Yeleen Ba (FRES), Lagazel et Yandalux''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Burkina%20Faso/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Burkina%20Faso_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_consultations_plus_0d6ca4a5', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Consultations Plus', '', 'NE', 'org_role_epc,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_minigrids', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the tier-2/tier-3 companies working with institutional clients in Niger. The section states Niger has ''de nombreuses sociétés d''ingénierie, d''approvisionnement et de construction expérimentées'' and that these firms ''agissent également en tant qu''intégrateurs de systèmes, participant aux appels d''offres pour la fourniture et l''installation de systèmes plus importants''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_tessa_power_9fe0c3cd', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Tessa Power', '', 'NE', 'org_role_epc,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the large tier-2/tier-3 companies in Niger working with institutional clients and acting as a system integrator bidding for supply-and-install tenders for larger solar systems.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_la_sah_lienne_du_g_nie_lectrique_8525cdf8', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'La Sahélienne du Génie Électrique', '', 'NE', 'org_role_epc,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the large tier-2/tier-3 companies in Niger working with institutional clients and acting as a system integrator bidding for supply-and-install tenders for larger solar systems.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_benafsol_b5afd6bf', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Benafsol', '', 'NE', 'org_role_epc,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the large tier-2/tier-3 companies in Niger working with institutional clients and acting as a system integrator bidding for supply-and-install tenders for larger solar systems.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_kanf_electronics_04d5fac8', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Kanf Electronics', '', 'NE', 'org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', '''Kanf Electronics est également un fabricant et un grossiste qui, comme la plupart des grands acteurs du solaire au Niger, n''offre pas de lanternes Pico mais seulement des SHS de plus de 220W''; has begun offering PAYG consumer credit.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_ets_lumi_re_du_sahel_fea66e50', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Ets Lumière du Sahel', '', 'NE', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', '''Ets Lumière du Sahel est une entreprise locale, à la fois grossiste et détaillant, qui vend une large gamme de systèmes solaires domestiques et de systèmes plug and play.'' Report notes only some Niger firms do their own installation; others subcontract it.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Niger/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Niger_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_taaka_solarenergy_65ee6335', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'TAAKA-SolarEnergy', 'https://www.taaka-solar.com', 'NE', 'org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'Company site, Niamey (Station Sonef Cité Progrès), describing itself as ''Votre partenaire solaire au Sahel — Installation • Maintenance • Dépannage • Études solaires''. Services: autonomous and hybrid PV systems, domestic and professional solar kits, solar power stations for isolated sites, solar pumping; installation by qualified local technicians.', 'https://www.taaka-solar.com/', 0),
  ('cand_org_solarex_energy_sarlu_35edf123', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Solarex-Energy SARLU', 'https://solarex-energy.com', 'NE', 'org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_epc', 'org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_epcs', 'Company site, Niamey (Quartier Bobiel): ''Solarex-energy est une entreprise spécialisée dans les nouvelles technologies de l''énergie principalement l''énergie solaire.'' Off-grid PV installations, grid-connected hybrid systems, solar pumping (Lorentz, Grundfos, Solatech), mini AEP water systems, public solar lighting; serves businesses, administrations, NGOs and international organisations.', 'https://solarex-energy.com/', 0),
  ('cand_org_woco_solar_44a84a46', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Woco Solar', '', 'GN', 'org_role_installer,org_role_distributor,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'The only tier-3 solar company identified in Guinea and explicitly ''une société locale basée en Guinée''. Report states local solar firms organised through APER-Guinée provide ''une large gamme de produits et systèmes OGS de haute qualité ainsi que des services d''installation, d''F&E et d''après-vente''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Guinea/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Guinea_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_rkomp_2b5128a3', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'RKomp', '', 'GN', 'org_role_equipment_supplier,org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', '''Parmi les entreprises de niveau 1, RKomp est le seul fabricant local'' in Guinea. Tableau 37 lists it (as ''Rkomp Solar'') across all four system categories including ''Très grand fournisseur de systèmes''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Guinea/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Guinea_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_batco_engineering_973c4aee', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Batco Engineering', '', 'GN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_oems', 'Named as one of Guinea''s manufacturer representatives acting as local distributors of international brands; APER-Guinée member firms are described as providing installation, O&M and after-sales services.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Guinea/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Guinea_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_bb_fils_534b926b', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'BB & Fils', '', 'GN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose (spelled ''BB&Fils'') as a manufacturer representative and local distributor of international brands in Guinea; Tableau 37 lists it (as ''BB & Fils'') across all four system size categories including very large system supply.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Guinea/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Guinea_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_sines_3e0b0f1d', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-030', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Sines', '', 'GN', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo,org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_oems', 'Named in prose (as ''SINES'') as a manufacturer representative and local distributor in Guinea; Tableau 37 lists it (as ''Sines'') across all four system size categories.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Guinea/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Guinea_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0);

