  ('cand_org_aress_989ec8e7', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'ARESS', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the eleven companies selected by MCA-Bénin II under the 2nd OCEF call. The ECREEE ROGEP Bénin report independently names ARESS as a leading Beninese manufacturer representative and one of the country''s main SHS distributors, offering ''la conception, l''installation et l''exploitation et la maintenance après la vente''.', 'https://www.24haubenin.info/?MCA-selectionne-11-entreprises-pour-executer-les-projects-OCEF', 0),
  ('cand_org_asemi_3e786b25', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'ASEMI', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_epcs', 'Named among the eleven companies selected by MCA-Bénin II under the 2nd OCEF call. The ECREEE ROGEP Bénin report independently names ASEMI as an experienced Beninese wholesaler/retailer and one of the main SHS distributors, offering design, installation and after-sales O&M.', 'https://www.24haubenin.info/?MCA-selectionne-11-entreprises-pour-executer-les-projects-OCEF', 0),
  ('cand_org_enerdas_bd46101b', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Enerdas', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named as one of Benin''s large wholesaler-retailers and one of the main SHS distributors; one of only two Beninese firms offering plug-and-play systems. Report states these firms ''offrent également généralement des services d''installation et d''F&E pour les produits qu''elles vendent aux clients''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_soconeme_ad070194', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Soconeme', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named as a Beninese manufacturer representative and one of the country''s main solar home system distributors.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_bio_solar_nergie_plus_2028ef6f', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Bio Solar Énergie Plus', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among Benin''s large wholesaler-retailers and, as ''Bio Solar Energy Plus'', one of only two firms in the country offering plug-and-play systems.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_groupe_atiwib_ca758446', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'groupe Atiwib', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor,org_role_installer', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named among Benin''s large solar companies operating as both wholesaler and retailer: ''les grandes entreprises sont généralement à la fois des grossistes et des détaillants (Ex. Enerdas, Asemi, le groupe Atiwib, Bio Solar Énergie Plus)''.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_ego_services_76aa7f0c', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-031', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Ego Services', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', '''Ego Services, Ismast Energy et Cetra sont les principaux distributeurs de produits pico solaires dans le pays.'' No specific installation evidence beyond the report''s general statement about after-sales installation and O&M.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_cetra_6fa12145', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Cetra', '', 'BJ', 'org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_oems', 'Named as one of the three leading distributors of pico solar products in Benin, alongside Ego Services and Ismast Energy.', 'https://old.greenmaxcap.com/download/ROGEP%20Reports/Benin/ECREEE%20ROGEP_Benin_Final%20Report_FR.pdf', 0),
  ('cand_org_e2ie_entreprise_ivoirienne_d_int_gration_0bff12c2', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'E2IE (Entreprise Ivoirienne d''Intégration Energétique)', 'https://www.e2ie-afrique.com', 'CI', 'org_role_epc,org_role_installer,org_role_system_integrator,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_efficiency_demand', 'org_group_epcs', 'SARL founded 2016, based in Cocody, Abidjan, with projects across West and Central Africa. Site states ''Etude, fourniture et installation d''équipements d''électricité solaire et pompages solaires de 1,5kw jusqu''à plusieurs Mégawatts'', ~2 MWc of solar installed in Côte d''Ivoire and the sub-region, and over 60 PV sites rehabilitated in Côte d''Ivoire. Also does ISO 50001 energy auditing, LV/MV electrical installation and civil works.', 'https://www.e2ie-afrique.com/', 0),
  ('cand_org_ad_solar_sarl_6cf1d639', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'AD Solar SARL', 'https://adsolar.org', 'CI', 'org_role_installer,org_role_epc,org_role_distributor', 'org_segment_minigrids,org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_productive_use,org_segment_shs_paygo', 'org_group_epcs', 'Company installation page: performs solar installations including mini-grids, residential systems, semi-industrial and industrial installations, solar water heaters and solar pumping, in Côte d''Ivoire. Describes itself as ''pionnier de la promotion des energies renouvelables en Côte d''Ivoire''.', 'https://adsolar.org/installation-solaire', 0),
  ('cand_org_sys_energies_4e461b99', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'SYS ENERGIES', 'https://www.sysenergies.com', 'CI', 'org_role_installer,org_role_om_asset_manager,org_role_energy_service_company', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial,org_segment_energy_storage,org_segment_efficiency_demand', 'org_group_epcs', 'Headquartered in Abidjan with a regional office in Bouaké; ''Intervention prioritaire sur toute la Côte d''Ivoire''. Installs PV systems for residential and industrial clients (grid-connected or isolated), battery storage, solar street and urban lighting, and provides electrical and solar maintenance and energy audits.', 'https://www.sysenergies.com/', 0),
  ('cand_org_ciprel_compagnie_ivoirienne_de_productio_cae5dff5', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'CIPREL (Compagnie Ivoirienne de Production d''Electricité)', '', 'CI', 'org_role_developer_ipp,org_role_om_asset_manager', 'org_segment_utility_generation', 'org_group_developers', 'Listed by the Ivorian electricity regulator ANARE-CI as an independent power producer: convention signed 20 July 1994 for construction, operation and transfer of a thermal power plant; five units totalling ~288 MW; gas-fired with HVO backup; minimum 2,154 GWh/yr under a take-or-pay obligation. Thermal, not solar.', 'https://anare.ci/espaces-operateurs-prives/les-producteurs-independants-delectricite/', 0),
  ('cand_org_azito_energie_69b9cfab', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'AZITO ENERGIE', '', 'CI', 'org_role_developer_ipp', 'org_segment_utility_generation', 'org_group_developers', 'Listed by ANARE-CI as an independent power producer: BOOT concession convention signed 5 September 1997 for 24 years, Azito thermal plant, three phases totalling ~450 MW, gas-fired with DDO backup. The regulator notes operations are delegated to a separate entity, AZITO O&M. Thermal, not solar.', 'https://anare.ci/espaces-operateurs-prives/les-producteurs-independants-delectricite/', 0),
  ('cand_org_sewto_c791e6a1', 'sweep-2026-08-epc-minigrid-032', 'agent_web_sweep', 'Sewto', '', 'MA', 'org_role_installer', 'org_segment_commercial_industrial', 'org_group_epcs', 'Listed as Taqa Pro PV+ labelled solar installer (AMEE label)', 'https://taqapro.ma/entreprises-labellisees-taqapro/', 0),
